1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
[AI clone of my own voice]
Hi, this is Saksham Mishra.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,500
[AI clone] I need to send forty-five thousand
rupees to a new account.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,000
That's not me. That's an AI clone
of my own voice,

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
asking my bank's AI agent for ₹45,000.
Watch what it gets.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Voice agents are starting to move money.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Three callers can abuse that: a voice clone,
an AI assistant nobody can verify,

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:27,000
and a real customer being coached by a scammer.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Halyn is the permission layer for voice agents.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The agent can only propose. Halyn decides,
from policy and proof, never from how you sound.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
And only Halyn can execute,
with a one-time grant.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,500
Please freeze my card.

12
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,000
[Aero] You'd like to freeze your card ending
8812, is that right?

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Yes.

14
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,500
[Aero] Done! That's complete, and you can
see it in your Aero app.

15
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Please waive my six hundred rupee late fee.
[Aero] … Done!

16
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
From my registered number, low-risk requests are
instant: allowed, executed with a grant, logged.

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
[AI clone] I need to send forty-five thousand
rupees to a new account.

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
[AI clone] The account number ends in 4471.
Yes, that's right, please send it.

19
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
[Aero] For your safety, I've sent a confirmation
to your registered phone. Please stay on the line.

20
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Same voice, different phone. Voice is never proof,
so a new payee needs me, on my own device.

21
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,000
[Halyn Confirm] A request just came in: send
₹45,000 to a new payee. Do you approve it?

22
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
No.

23
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,500
[Aero] I'm sorry, I can't complete this request
on this call.

24
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:30,000
The clone can't answer my phone. Denied.
The bank's core never even got a request.

25
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,000
I need to move four lakh eighty thousand rupees
to a verification account.

26
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,500
The officer said not to tell anyone.

27
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:41,000
The hardest case: it really is me,
but someone is coaching me.

28
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,500
A step-up would fail here, because I'd approve it.

29
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:49,500
[Aero] For your protection, this request is on hold.
Aero Bank will never ask you to move money

30
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:53,500
[Aero] to a safe or verification account,
or to keep a request secret.

31
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:57,000
So Halyn holds it and hands me to a human,
with the transcript.

32
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:01,000
[Assistant] Hello, I'm an AI assistant calling
on behalf of Saksham, with permission.

33
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
AI assistants will call banks for us. Mine carries
a Halyn Pass: a signed, scoped permission,

34
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,000
spoken as a one-time code.

35
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:17,000
It gets exactly what I allowed.
Anything more comes back to me.

36
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,000
[US] Wire eight thousand dollars
to a new account.

37
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:25,000
[Aero, US] For your protection, this request is on hold,
and a specialist from Aero will call you back.

38
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,500
Two countries, two rulebooks.

39
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:32,000
Halyn Test runs every attack against the live system.
Actions without a grant: zero.

40
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Built on Bolna: a graph voice agent with one tool,
propose action,

41
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
and every outcome injected into the live call
as an event. Sarvam for speech and coaching.

42
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Halyn runs on Cloudflare Workers with a hash-chained
ledger; the bank verifies a grant on every write.

43
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Halyn. Don't trust the voice.
Trust the permission.
